  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260c28e052aba35094e63e8/step-404ed7c3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Place a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn until charred, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a medium bowl.\n• Grate carrot. Finely chop red onion. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260c28e052aba35094e63e8/step-6653a4b1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When rice has 10 mins remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot and onion, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in remaining garlic, spicy taco seasoning (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and tomato paste, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in butter beans (including liquid) and remaining butter, until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260c28e052aba35094e63e8/step-d23ea6e4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To charred corn, add spinach and a drizzle of white white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss to combine.\n• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with Mexican black bean chilli, charred corn salsa and shredded cheddar cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6260c28e052aba35094e63e8/step-cdcc498b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
